{
  "_comment": [
    "What the flow that builds this chip will and will not accept, taken",
    "from the flow's own record rather than from documentation.",
    "",
    "Written 2026-09-06 for G.3 step 7. The runbook left the Arm C region",
    "binding blank because the command differs between flow versions and",
    "the generator had run neither. This is the answer to that: the flow",
    "is LibreLane, and its whole configuration surface is listed below.",
    "",
    "Two versions are involved and the difference matters. The run",
    "directory on this disk was produced by 3.0.3. CI hardens with",
    "tt-gds-action@ttsky26c, whose librelane-version input defaults to",
    "3.0.5. The four files that decide every placement question are",
    "byte identical between the two tags, and their SHA-256 values are",
    "recorded below so anybody can check that without taking my word.",
    "",
    "gds_build/ is not mirrored to the clone, so CI cannot rebuild this",
    "file. It is a pinned record, the same arrangement as",
    "extraction/library_sources.json. chip/gen_placement_cfg.py reads it",
    "and --refresh-surface rebuilds it on a machine that has the run",
    "directory. That mode fails rather than skips when the directory is",
    "missing."
  ],
